    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2014-10-06; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Tall, alert, and engaged; speaks in full sentences; weight 80.6 kg, BMI 23.6</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Pupils equal and reactive; near vision 20/30 with reading glasses</td></tr><tr><td>Ears</td><td>Canals clear; whispered-voice test missed on the left, passed on the right</td></tr><tr><td>Neck</td><td>No jugular venous distension; no thyroid enlargement or nodes</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Regular rhythm at 76 per minute; distant heart sounds; no murmur; no edema</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Hyperinflated chest; reduced breath sounds throughout; prolonged expiration; no wheeze or crackles; oxygen saturation 94 percent on room air</td></tr><tr><td>Abdomen</td><td>Soft and non-tender; no masses</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Timed Up and Go 11 seconds; rises from a chair without using his arms</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Alert and oriented; gait steady; Mini-Cog 5 of 5</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Euthymic and engaged; judgment and insight intact</td></tr><tr><td>Skin</td><td>No cyanosis or clubbing; no suspicious lesions</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

