<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 25 minutes, with his consent. We talked about what COPD at this stage can mean over the coming years, including flare-ups that may need hospital care, and why it helps to plan ahead. He named a health care agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He said that what matters most to him is staying at home, keeping up his creative work, and being told plainly about his health so he can make his own decisions. He chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly and after any hospital stay. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
